# Quarantine damaged containers immediately and report them to (preference)

Standing user preference: Quarantine damaged containers immediately and report them to Quality; do not use a damaged container even if it appears mostly intact.

## Conventions
- Quarantine damaged containers immediately and report them to Quality; do not use a damaged container even if it appears mostly intact.

